  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guatemala Joint Programme -  Civil Society</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is to further strengthen and consolidate an empowered and resilient civil society where people and communities lead their own development, live in harmony and dignity without violence, and jointly promote sustainable and resilient development models. This will be done by engaging marginalised populations, including the Indigenous and women in participatory processes to enable locally led development.</narrative>
  </description>
